        "original_id": "ba1109d1-5b0e-56e7-b6a4-dd950a30d0a3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Return to Oz, Midnight Madness\n- People: Walter Murch, Gill Dennis, Paul Maslansky, David Naughton, Stephen Furst, Maggie Roswell, David Shire, Mathew Laibowitz\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Projects: Midnight Madness urban experience\n- Topics: film production, film scores, stage musicals\n\nFacts:\n- Midnight Madness is a 1980 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions and starring David Naughton, Stephen Furst, and Maggie Roswell.\n- Return to Oz is a 1985 fantasy adventure film directed and written by Walter Murch, co-written by Gill Dennis, and produced by Paul Maslansky.\n- David Shire composed the score for the 1985 film Return to Oz and also wrote stage musical scores for Baby, Closer Than Ever, and Starting Here, Starting Now.\n- Mathew Laibowitz founded an urban experience named Midnight Madness in 1996 after the 1980 film Midnight Madness.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
